Package: vaillant-boiler-ui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), python3-bcrypt, adduser
Recommends: apache2-utils
Suggests: ebusd
Homepage: https://github.com/zannen/vaillant-boiler-controller-ui
Description: logger and web UI for Vaillant boilers via ebusd
 Polls a Vaillant boiler through ebusd, logs readings to CSV and serves a
 live web UI with gauges, charts and a change log. Logins are checked against
 an htpasswd file, with admin, user and viewer roles.
